        },
        {
          "text": "04/02/2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1997,
          "end": 2007
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The present Criminal Misc. Petition has been filed by the petitioner under Section 482 Cr.P.C. being aggrieved by the order dated 19.10.2022 passed by the learned Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate No. 4, Jodhpur Metropolitan, whereby the complaint filed by the petitioner was dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2008,
      "end": 2297,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 482",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2083,
          "end": 2094
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2095,
          "end": 2102
        },
        {
          "text": "19.10.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2138,
          "end": 2148
        },
        {
          "text": "Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate No. 4, Jodhpur Metropolitan",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2171,
          "end": 2235
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Aggrieved thereby, the petitioner preferred a revision petition before the learned Additional Sessions Judge, which also came to be dismissed vide order dated 24.02.2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2298,
      "end": 2468,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "24.02.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2457,
          "end": 2467
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that on a bare perusal of the complaint as well as the statements recorded, the ingredients of the offences pressed into service against the respondent are clearly made out; however, the learned Trial Court wrongly dismissed the complaint and the revisional Court also failed to properly consider the material on record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2469,
      "end": 2833,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "This Court has considered the orders passed by the learned Trial Court as well as the Revisional Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2835,
      "end": 2938,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
